        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Help ABC Expand to Empower More Young Minds in Teton Valley</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/53568.webp" alt="Help ABC Expand to Empower More Young Minds in Teton Valley" loading="lazy">
        </div>

        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p>Big news! ABC-Above and Beyond the Classroom in Teton Valley is thrilled to announce the expansion of our programs to include 4th and 5th graders, beginning in the 2025-26 school year. This growth will allow our after-school, fifth-day, and summer initiatives to support even more students in the Teton Valley community.</p>

<p>The 4th-5th grade program will place a strong emphasis on <strong>STEM education</strong>, ensuring that students gain hands-on experience in science, technology, engineering, and mathematics—skills that are increasingly crucial in our world today. Our programs also prioritize <strong>social-emotional learning</strong>, helping children build resilience, confidence, and strong interpersonal skills.</p>

<p>Through partnerships with local organizations, ABC offers <strong>enrichment opportunities</strong> that introduce kids to art, music, sports, performing arts, and outdoor adventures. These collaborations enable children to connect with community members and discover new opportunities.</p>

<p>With this expansion comes the need for additional funding to support more resources, activities, curriculum, and dedicated staff. Every dollar we raise during the Tin Cup Challenge goes directly to ABC students and families, ensuring they have a safe and inspiring place to learn outside of school hours.</p>

<p>Join us in making a difference! Whether you donate, volunteer, or spread the word, your support helps bring education and adventure to more children.&nbsp;</p>

